    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2269de64b163510d1485fbf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑、跑……跑……！　觉得总有一天、总有一天……\r\n但是，那是不可能的……你什么都不懂……",
      "source_fingerprint": "53131930f2079a3fd7dcf045541d0f1bd732161c2aa75fd38d082ac7c7d2ba62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
