      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（有伙伴在的话，就能消除那些噪音。然后为了寻找能最有效地\n证明自己的地方――我关注到了特雷森学园。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "bebe8a0f74667e6691dc56af724e42138765aaa6748ba9c12db84a866a2bddbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
